      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why is there a post here?\n\nIf the post is only to ensure that handleUdpSocketDestroy runs on |handler|, then that is already guaranteed to happen:\n- This lambda becomes udpSkDestroyListener.mSkDestroyCallback.\n- mSkDestroyCallback is only ever called by processNetlinkMessage\n- processNetlinkMessage runs on the same thread as |handler|, because FdEventsReader calls addOnFileDescriptorEventListener on the MessageQueue that it gets using mHandler.getLooper().getQueue().\n\nIf the post is needed for some other reason, then maybe update the comment?",
